WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.976
Sketch a neighbourhood map with home, important places and main routes.

00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:09.308
A neighbourhood map is a simple drawing that shows where places are found. Put

00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:13.509
familiar landmarks such as the market, school, clinic or police station on it.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.435
Use lines for roads and a key to explain symbols. Simple directions such as left,

00:00:19.435 --> 00:00:22.815
right, near and opposite make a sketch easier to use.

00:00:23.617 --> 00:00:28.648
With an adult, observe safe familiar routes and draw a sketch that does not show

00:00:28.648 --> 00:00:29.654
anyone’s private details.
